{"path":"s77","heading":"Resort to arbitral or judicial proceedings.","in_1996":true,"nodes_1996":[{"path":"s77","node_type":"section","number":"77","heading":"Resort to arbitral or judicial proceedings.","text":"The parties shall not initiate, during the conciliation proceedings, any arbitral or judicial proceedings in respect of a dispute that is the subject-matter of the conciliation proceedings except that a party may initiate arbitral or judicial proceedings where, in his opinion, such proceedings are necessary for preserving his rights."}],"events":[]}